s/009bbbb87310edbe3a19fdc54f724fea.mp4?t=1644784483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Minimalist game designed and created to deliver a pleasant and great gameplay experience.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 hand-crafted levels with increasing complexity(Can you solve them all? )<br></li><li>Originally composed Soundtracks<br></li><li>Beautiful minimalist aesthetic<br></li><li>Playable with mouse and keyboard.<br></li><li>Isometric and perspective camera modes.<br></li><li>Color palette change.<br></li><li>Unlimited undo moves.</li></ul>",
